      "hotelDescription":"Take centre stage at Premier Inn London Leicester Square, right in the heart of the West End. With our friendly team and extra-comfy beds you'll get that all-singing, all-dancing London experience but without the blockbuster prices. \n\nYou're perfectly placed for the West End shows, restaurants and bars. You'll find endless shopping at Oxford Street and Covent Garden. And there's culture and history just minutes away, from Trafalgar Square to Buckingham Palace. And, because we're so central, you're never far from a place to put your feet up and prepare for the encore.",
      "hotelOpeningDate":"",
      "hotelSPFDescription":"",
      "hotelDirections":"Nearest tube stations are Leicester Sq (Northern and Piccadilly lines). Follow Cranbourne St into Leicester Sq and the hotel is located on the right (Leicester Pl). Bus routes serving Charing Cross, Haymarket, Shaftsbury Ave and Trafalgar Sq are a short walk away. Charing Cross stn, served by South East Rail is under 10 mins walk. Local car parks include China Town and Witcombe St, both are under 10 mins walk away and are chargable.",
